{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "description": "Golden eval dataset for the RAG pipeline (RR-036). One shared dataset reused across intent-classifier eval, retriever eval, and generation/faithfulness eval.",
  "notes": "`relevant[].key` uses NHTSA's natural identifiers (NHTSACampaignNumber for recalls, odiNumber for complaints), NOT the Postgres SERIAL `id` returned by vector_search.sql - that id is insertion-order-dependent and isn't stable across a rebuilt DB. Join on these natural keys against the live DB when scoring the retriever. `general_question` examples have empty `relevant`/`gold_answer_contains` because run_pipeline() short-circuits before retrieval for that intent (see src/pipeline.py) -- they only feed classifier eval.",
